  "richContent": "<p>仓位 &amp; 收益率</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>昨天的是因为规模限制的“被动卖出”，换仓“自助平移买入”在组合外，但还是想和且慢数据保持一致，所以想更新一下。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>【150】 无交易，仅同步更新数据。 </p>\n<p></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p></p>\n<p>【S】仓位变动 </p>\n<p></p>\n<p>A： 63.09% → 62.10% </p>\n<p></p>\n<p>H： 13.63% → 13.49% </p>\n<p></p>\n<p>A+H： 76.72% → 75.59% </p>\n<p></p>\n<p>股： 81.20% → 79.99% </p>\n<p></p>\n<p>债： 18.80% → 18.64% </p>\n<p></p>\n<p>现金： 0.00% → 1.37% </p>\n<p></p>\n<p>-- </p>\n<p></p>\n<p>行业： 31.17% → 29.73% </p>\n<p></p>\n<p>消费： 10.68% → 9.72% </p>\n<p></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<img src=\"https://cdn-community.qieman.com/08614E63-E43A-4E77-AE8D-8C8524EDA7FE.png\" />\n<img src=\"https://cdn-community.qieman.com/D3859AEE-8452-49ED-BEFA-D58E0CA3C3B7.png\" />\n<img src=\"https://cdn-community.qieman.com/9600DF5E-83D8-4094-89DC-1DB3001C5D27.png\" />\n<img src=\"https://cdn-community.qieman.com/D1ADEEB4-4E4A-46D0-960E-A44B5E401B59.png\" />\n<img src=\"https://cdn-community.qieman.com/074EF457-04BE-497A-925F-B26CCFAB4947.png\" />\n<img src=\"https://cdn-community.qieman.com/493D7A38-8B99-4EA2-BD21-EF73879CE89D.png\" />\n<img src=\"https://cdn-community.qieman.com/2367FE34-200B-41C2-B6B4-0D724D1B323C.png\" />\n<img src=\"https://cdn-community.qieman.com/7B223A0C-0C6A-4B23-8B60-28406409D3A9.png\" />",
